course: dictionary
lesson: 10036
title: Formal words and what they mean
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words sound grown-up because they appear in letters, contracts and official notices. Termination is one of them. Its main idea is ending: something stops. Read the words around it to find out what is ending.
explain: «The company sent a letter about the termination of the agreement.» An agreement is a promise between people, so termination here means the agreement has come to an end. Check by swapping in a simpler word: "the end of the agreement". If it still makes sense, you have the right meaning.
explain: «Her termination of employment came after a year.» Employment means work, so termination of employment means a person has been dismissed from a job. In everyday talk, people say "sacked" or "let go". On a bus, «this service terminates here» means the journey ends at that stop.
fact: Termination means the ending of something.
fact: «Termination of the agreement» means the agreement has come to an end.
fact: «Termination of employment» means a person is dismissed from their job.
fact: On a bus or train, «this service terminates here» means the journey stops at that place.
fact: Some medical texts use termination in a grown-up sense; if you meet that, ask a trusted adult to explain it.
exercise: «The company sent a letter about the termination of the agreement.» What does termination mean here? | A reward | A start | *An ending | A sound
exercise: «She got news of her termination of employment on Monday.» What does this mean? | She was promoted to a new job | *She was dismissed from her job | She got a free lunch | She began a holiday
exercise: In «this service terminates here», which word tells you the bus stops its journey? | here | *terminates | service | this
test: Ben says termination means a start. What does it mean? | A beginning | A party | A map | *An ending
test: Which everyday word could replace termination in «termination of contract»? | Begin | Reward | *End | Hello
exam: In «the termination of the agreement», what is being ended? | the letter | *the agreement | the sun | the company
